{"id": "69212", "title": "擒妻", "author": "三长两短", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 26, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69212.htm", "intro": "武烈：“于胜男，你昨天没给我生日礼物。”\r\n于胜男：“哪有人自己要生日礼物的？”\r\n武烈：“于胜男，我要跟你离婚！”\r\n于胜男：“……”\r\n\r\n武烈：“你今天是不是见了个小白脸？”\r\n于胜男：“那是我表弟，不是小白脸。”\r\n武烈：“我要跟你离婚！”\r\n于胜男：“……”\r\n\r\n总之一句话：武烈碰到于胜男，那就是诺曼底登陆，登陆的不是他，是于胜男！\r\n他说是节节败退还是轻的，直白一点就是一败涂地！\r\n\r\n作者说：入坑须谨慎，有天雷，有狗血，有小白，有矫情，总之是披着高干与军旅外衣的雷轰文，不接受扒榜，谢谢支持！！", "base": "files/article/html/69/69212", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子：于胜男，我要跟你离婚", "file": "10587621.html", "available": false}, {"title": "001", "file": "10587622.html", "available": false}, {"title": "002", "file": "10587623.html", "available": false}, {"title": "003", "file": "10587624.html", "available": false}, {"title": "004", "file": "10587625.html", "available": false}, {"title": "005", "file": "10587626.html", "available": false}, {"title": "006", "file": "10587627.html", "available": false}, {"title": "007", "file": "10587628.html", "available": false}, {"title": "008", "file": "10587629.html", "available": false}, {"title": "009", "file": "10587630.html", "available": false}, {"title": "010（已补全）", "file": "10587631.html", "available": false}, {"title": "011", "file": "10587632.html", "available": false}, {"title": "012", "file": "10587633.html", "available": false}, {"title": "013（已补全）", "file": "10587634.html", "available": false}, {"title": "014", "file": "10587635.html", "available": false}, {"title": "015", "file": "10587636.html", "available": false}, {"title": "016-017", "file": "10587637.html", "available": false}, {"title": "018", "file": "10587638.html", "available": false}, {"title": "019", "file": "10587639.html", "available": false}, {"title": "020", "file": "10587640.html", "available": false}, {"title": "021", "file": "10587641.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-26", "file": "10587642.html", "available": false}, {"title": "27-32", "file": "10587643.html", "available": false}, {"